        "text": "Morgan\u2019s employment agreement required arbitration of any dispute, raising the question of whether Sundance could waive that right by filing a motion to dismiss and omitting any reference to arbitration."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5f9681d83b18ec27196b249b714269cded64cf31c4159df0d45a5463ed299cb1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5f9681d83b18-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court needed to decide whether a new procedural rule could be fashioned under the FAA\u2019s arbitration\u2011favoring policy."
      }
    ],
